# Default: normalise every text file to LF in the repository, UTF-8 on disk.
# Constitution, *Portability*: one file must not change shape between machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# --- Documented encoding exceptions ---------------------------------------
# MetaEditor writes MQL5 sources as UTF-16LE on some builds. Detect the real
# encoding at bootstrap (BOOTSTRAP.md, step 3) and record it in techContext.md.
# If the sources are UTF-16, uncomment the two lines below; git then stores
# them as UTF-8 and restores UTF-16LE in the working tree, so MetaEditor keeps
# working and diffs stay readable. If they are UTF-8, delete this block.
# *.mq5  working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE eol=CRLF
# *.mqh  working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE eol=CRLF

# MetaEditor compile logs are UTF-16 and are never normalised.
*.log -text

# --- Binary ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.ex5  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
